3864   1420             
3865   1420             ; Alien tile-strip catalog table:
3866   1420             ; A packed list of shape strips.
3867   1420             ; Raw foreground character codes that make up each alien (and related) shape.
3868   1420             ; It is not indexed by shape number directly — drawing uses an LSB into page `$14`, usually produced by `T1600`.
3869   1420             ; Indexing chain:
3870   1420             ; movement opcode
3871   1420             ;    -> T16A0 (draw size + how to use X/Y + base into T1600)
3872   1420             ;        -> T1600[+subindex]  = LSB
3873   1420             ;            -> alien control state B
3874   1420             ;                -> HL = $14 | LSB
3875   1420             ;                    -> T1420 tile bytes drawn to screen
3876   1420             ; Duplicates track the 4-phase X/Y fine-scroll index — two phases,
3877   1420             ; same picture -> same tile pair stored (or same pointer repeated) twice.
3878   1420             T1420:
3879   1420 60 61                              .DB $60, $61           ;alien shape #1
