8425   391C             ;*****************************************************************************
8426   391C             ;* Wing mask (`$3BB0`+B) — `L38BC`, reached from `L391C` when `B >= $20`.
8427   391C             ;*****************************************************************************
8428   391C             L391C:
8429   391C 78                                 LD      A,B                 ; 
8430   391D FE 20                              CP      $20                 ; 
8431   391F D2 BC 38                           JP      NC,L38BC            ;  if B >= $20, test the wing mask
8432   3922 C9                                 RET                         ; 
