8905   3B60             ; Per-character horizontal hit-mask table for bird collision used at $3844.
8906   3B60             ; It's the lookup that lets the player's bullet hit a bird only
8907   3B60             ; where the bird's graphic tile actually has solid pixels, rather than treating the whole 8-pixel character cell as solid.
8908   3B60             ; Body mask table:
8909   3B60             T3B60:
